      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_03",
      "hash64": "1C7DF2F0B244518B",
      "text": "Para nada...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_03",
      "hash64": "57E70115A01D8C31",
      "text": "Muy bien, ja, ja.\\nAhora os conozco un poquitín mejor.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_04",
      "hash64": "57E70215A01D8DE4",
      "text": "A algunos os atraen las matemáticas y a otros no.\\nTenemos una clase de lo más variada. Fantástico.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_05",
      "hash64": "57E70315A01D8F97",
      "text": "Si os gustan, mejor que mejor. Y si no, no os\\npreocupéis.\\c\\nIremos poquito a poquito e intentaré hacerlas\\nlo más amenas posible, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
